			(property "Description" "4-Bit Bi-Directional Level Shifter\n\n• 1.2V-3.6V (VCCA) to 1.65V-5.5V (VCCB) bi-directional level shifter with auto direction sensing.\n• Max data rate - VCCA 1.8V:  20Mbps (50ns), VCCA 3.3V: 100Mbps (10ns)\n• Digikey: 296-21929-1-ND (TSSOP)\n\nhttp://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/BreakoutBoards/txb0104.pdf Datasheet\n\nSparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13120 SparkFun Cellular Shield - MG2639 (CEL-13120)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13743 SparkFun Level Shifting microSD Breakout (DEV-13743)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11771 SparkFun Voltage-Level Translator Breakout - TXB0104 (BOB-11771)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13040 SparkFun Block for Intel® Edison - UART (DEV-13040)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13036 SparkFun Block for Intel® Edison - Arduino (DEV-13036)"
